              "value": "Funnel"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(cold, primal, water)\n\nThe kun inhales violently, sucking in heat and all creatures in the water in a 60-foot cone. Creatures take 10d8 cold damage and must attempt a DC 33 Fortitude save. The kun can't Funnel again for 1d4 rounds.\n\nCritical Success: The creature is unaffected.\nSuccess: The creature takes half damage.\nFailure: The creature takes full damage and is pulled 30 feet toward the kun.\nCritical Failure: The creature takes double damage and is pulled 60 feet toward the kun."
